{"id":"e91c1261e1c2374b","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-elementary.md","title":"Elementary Extension","display":"df-elementary — Elementary Extension","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-elementary","aliases":["58-df-elementary"],"display":"df-elementary — Elementary Extension","depends_on":["[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-substructure.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-assignment.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-elementary"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-elementary</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-elementary — Elementary Extension"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"563f382027630287\" href=\"?note=563f382027630287\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-substructure.md\">../batch13/58-df-substructure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md\">../batch03/58-df-assignment.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in V\">\\(\\Sigma,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\Sigma)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak B,\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak B,\\Sigma)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Substructure}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B,\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{Substructure}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B,\\Sigma)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"563f382027630287\" href=\"?note=563f382027630287\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-substructure.md\">../batch13/58-df-substructure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathfrak A,s)\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathfrak A,s)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md\">../batch03/58-df-assignment.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\Sigma,\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak A},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathfrak A})\">\\(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\Sigma,\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak A},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathfrak A})\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathfrak B,\\Sigma,\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak B},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathfrak B})\">\\(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathfrak B,\\Sigma,\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak B},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathfrak B})\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\\mathrm{df\\text{-}elementary}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Substructure}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B,\\Sigma)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak A},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathfrak A},\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak B},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathfrak B}\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\Sigma,\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak A},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathfrak A})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathfrak B,\\Sigma,\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak B},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathfrak B})\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\\forall s\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathfrak A,s)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{36mm}\\to(\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathfrak A}(\\varphi,s)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathfrak B}(\\varphi,s))\\bigr)\\Bigr).\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\\mathrm{df\\text{-}elementary}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Substructure}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B,\\Sigma)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak A},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathfrak A},\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak B},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathfrak B}\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\Sigma,\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak A},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathfrak A})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathfrak B,\\Sigma,\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak B},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathfrak B})\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\\forall s\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathfrak A,s)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{36mm}\\to(\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathfrak A}(\\varphi,s)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathfrak B}(\\varphi,s))\\bigr)\\Bigr).\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{A} \\preceq \\mathfrak{B}\">\\(\\mathfrak{A} \\preceq \\mathfrak{B}\\)</span> means <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{A}\">\\(\\mathfrak{A}\\)</span> is an elementary substructure of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{B}\">\\(\\mathfrak{B}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>By the Tarski-Vaught criterion: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{A} \\preceq \\mathfrak{B}\">\\(\\mathfrak{A} \\preceq \\mathfrak{B}\\)</span> iff for every formula <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(x, \\bar{y})\">\\(\\varphi(x, \\bar{y})\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar{b} \\in A\">\\(\\bar{b} \\in A\\)</span>, if <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{B} \\models \\exists x\\,\\varphi(x, \\bar{b})\">\\(\\mathfrak{B} \\models \\exists x\\,\\varphi(x, \\bar{b})\\)</span> then there exists <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a \\in A\">\\(a \\in A\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{B} \\models \\varphi(a, \\bar{b})\">\\(\\mathfrak{B} \\models \\varphi(a, \\bar{b})\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref